ent-VaccinatorFlatpack = vaccinator flatpack
    .desc = A packed vaccinator. Anchor and power it after assembly.
ent-VirologyNicergolineVial = nicergoline vial
    .desc = A reagent for decoding DNA viruses in samples outside the body.
ent-CrateVirologyResponse = virology response crate
    .desc = Packed diagnoser and vaccinator, sampling supplies and nicergoline. The machines require power.
pathology-rot-name = Rot syndrome
pathology-rot-detection-1 = DNA from a necrotic pathogen is present. Visible symptoms may be absent.
pathology-rot-detection-2 = The pathogen masks pain while damaging cells. Increased endurance is not recovery.
pathology-rot-detection-3 = Extensive tissue decay and infectious bloody vomiting. Suppress the infection and replace lost blood.
pathology-rot-detection-4 = Terminal colonization. After death, the body may burst within 1–2 minutes. Isolate and refrigerate it.
pathology-rot-examine-2 = Yellow inflamed patches mark the skin.
pathology-rot-examine-3 = Weeping sores cover the skin; blood seeps from the mouth.
pathology-rot-examine-4 = Dense nodules move beneath decaying skin.
pathology-rot-progress-2 = Pain fades, replaced by an unpleasant warmth.
pathology-rot-progress-3 = You taste blood. Each step feels heavier.
pathology-rot-progress-4 = Something moves under your skin. You urgently need medical attention!
rot-corpse-examine = The swollen body moves beneath its skin. Isolate and refrigerate it immediately!
ent-MobRotSpawn = rot spawn
    .desc = A short-lived creature grown inside a rot victim. Destroy it before it takes root.
ent-RotGrowth = rot growth
    .desc = A rooted colony spreading rot through the surrounding air. Cut or burn it away.
ent-RotVirusSample = vial
    .desc = A vial containing rot. Do not open outside a laboratory.
    .suffix = Rot
rot-mode-title = Rot
rot-mode-description = The sector's factions continue their struggle as a rot epidemic spreads.
rot-mode-preparation = The sector is unusually quiet. Something has already taken root.
rot-mode-warning-1 = Rot infection detected. Examine patients, isolate samples and find treatment. Animals are susceptible too.
rot-mode-warning-2 = Rot's dangerous life cycle has been detected. Terminal victims may spawn carriers after death. Isolate bodies; kill carriers before they take root.
rot-mode-warning-3 = Rooted rot colonies detected. Clear growths, use protection and breathe from internals. Check infected ships and animals.
rot-mode-controlled = No active rot carriers or colonies detected for ten minutes. The outbreak is controlled. Suppressed infections and stored samples still require care.
rot-mode-resurgence = Active rot detected again. Resume isolation, treatment and colony clearance.
rot-mode-round-end = Rot: initial carriers — { $seeded }; remaining active hosts — { $carriers }, incubating corpses — { $broods }, spawn — { $offspring }, colonies — { $reservoirs }.
